        {
          "id": 1213786548,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> Is there any reason why the ordinal block number should *not* be displayed?\n\n- Excludes a detail that some might find uninteresting (less clutter).\n- Existing scripts that expect/depend on the display without the ordinal block numbers.\n\nThe question I had asked myself was whether or not the ordinal block numbers should be displayed by default?\n\nI choose no because I'm not sure my personal preference (*yes*) should upset the status quo.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6682068,
            "username": "jim.young",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Jim Young",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/db9ae68fc706b78b6724093efb95f64d89ef17c6d9b3eb4b3d632bf196ff78fb?s=80&d=identicon",
